{
  "about": "The NPC say window (issues #445, #1369): 280x180 at (200, 100), text wrapped character by character at 215 px on a grey panel, no auto-scroll; the wheel scrolls 30 px and the line half out at the top still shows, cut at the panel; the scroll bar's arrows and track move 30 px and its thumb drags; the window drags by its frame, the old page stays after Next until the next one comes, and a clear empties the text but keeps the window; a colour holds over a line break in one packet and ^nItemID^ shows the item's name. The NPC (npc/say.txt) is loaded with @loadnpc and unloaded at both ends.",
  "account": "",
